1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,230
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,500
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,770
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:06,040
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,620
Someone like myself does not avoid others,

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,700
but I cannot share a bed
with someone who is intoxicated,

7
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:15,360
nor can I bind my life
to someone of different morals.

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:18,590
The chief knew about the clues
and kept them from me, Sarge.

9
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,550
He doesn't want me
to investigate the case.

10
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,300
For someone like me,

11
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,240
should I wish to have anyone
enamored of me,

12
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,480
my beauty alone

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,720
would suffice...

14
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,800
Wear this upon you.

15
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:32,000
Do not give it to anyone so readily again.

16
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,800
May the sacred beings watch over you

17
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,760
until your good intentions

18
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:40,080
prevail.

19
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,680
What's this?

20
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:05,850
Fabled iron, invulnerable, a mighty rampart.

21
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:09,720
Pure copper, a sacred amulet,
crafted with the master's spell and arts.

22
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:12,760
Lustrous gold, burning like the sun,
with power untold.

23
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,840
Untainted silver, breaking curses
beneath the moon's hold.

24
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,760
Blue bornite, guarding against harm,
imbued with might.

25
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:21,920
Wild mercury, reflecting poison
and sorcery's blight.

26
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:25,080
Zinc of yore, interlaced with all else,
their powers unveiled.

27
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:28,920
Forged into a weapon,
piercing every yantra without fail.

28
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,840
Here, I beseech the Buddha's virtues.

29
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:35,400
Here, I beseech the Buddhist Masters,
the Supreme Masters.

30
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,580
Buddham prasiddhi,

31
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,040
Dhammam prasiddhi,

32
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,800
through all of Na, Ma, Pa, Ta,

33
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,040
whatever incantation dwells within,

34
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,640
may it be ravaged,

35
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,360
may it be blighted

36
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:48,640
by the power of Namo Buddhaya.

37
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,720
Do use them

38
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,600
to uphold justice, as is your duty.

39
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,920
Stay here, my beautiful daughter.

40
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,080
Do not leave them.

41
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,080
One day...

42
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:15,030
they will come to you.

43
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:18,020
When that time comes,

44
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:22,240
only your compassion can aid them.

45
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:42,930
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

46
00:02:42,950 --> 00:02:47,600
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

47
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:51,930
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

48
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:56,250
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

49
00:02:56,270 --> 00:03:00,680
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

50
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:05,200
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

51
00:03:05,220 --> 00:03:09,310
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

52
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:13,880
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

53
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:18,530
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

54
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:47,890
Peem, how are you?

55
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,180
I'm fine, Mom.

56
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,320
Mom,

57
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:55,350
how is Phu doing?

58
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,650
The doctor says he's the same.

59
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:01,480
Physically, he looks normal.

60
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,780
He's alright now.

61
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:05,560
All that's left now
is for him to wake up on his own.

62
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:09,490
Peem,

63
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:13,790
can you promise me
just this once, to ease my mind,

64
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,270
that you won't get involved
with that case again?

65
00:04:21,090 --> 00:04:22,980
Don't worry about me, Mom.

66
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,140
I'm here...

67
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,340
I'm going to be okay.

68
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:30,980
Liar!

69
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,300
Just now,

70
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:41,280
what were you saying?

71
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:44,470
I said great.

72
00:04:44,490 --> 00:04:47,370
It gives me peace of mind
knowing you're safe over there.

73
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:49,280
What's wrong, Peem?

74
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,440
Right...

75
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:56,020
Nothing, Mom.

76
00:04:56,270 --> 00:04:58,970
I was probably just hearing things.

77
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:01,700
Well...

78
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:03,840
I'll get back to work now.

79
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:05,740
I'll call you later.

80
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,960
Take good care of yourself.

81
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:13,390
I'll call the chief regularly
to check on you, okay, Peem?

82
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:15,700
Alright, Mom.

83
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:28,870
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

84
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:30,030
Alright, here he comes.

85
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:32,610
- Hello.
- Hello.

86
00:05:32,730 --> 00:05:33,590
Hello.

87
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,320
Uh, this is...

88
00:05:35,710 --> 00:05:36,630
Inspector Chon,

89
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,340
stationed at Mae Sot Police Station.

90
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:39,870
He's Chai's nephew,

91
00:05:40,090 --> 00:05:41,790
the guy we saw at the municipal market.

92
00:05:42,890 --> 00:05:43,890
I remember.

93
00:05:44,590 --> 00:05:45,510
This is Lieutenant Peem.

94
00:05:45,890 --> 00:05:46,890
She was transferred from Bangkok

95
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,990
just to work on this case.

96
00:05:49,770 --> 00:05:50,750
Nice to meet you.

97
00:05:51,590 --> 00:05:53,110
Nice to meet you.

98
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:55,970
I think we should
get straight to the point.

99
00:05:55,990 --> 00:05:57,590
I have somewhere to be after this.

100
00:05:58,890 --> 00:06:00,480
What? Didn't you take a day off today?

101
00:06:04,890 --> 00:06:06,710
Alright, let's take
this conversation over there.

102
00:06:06,730 --> 00:06:07,390
Alright.

103
00:06:09,790 --> 00:06:10,630
Lieutenant,

104
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,350
here's the file you're looking for.

105
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:17,220
From the clues I've gathered in secret,

106
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,400
Krating and his guys

107
00:06:19,570 --> 00:06:22,590
are moving along
the Thailand-Myanmar border.

108
00:06:23,590 --> 00:06:25,110
But even now,

109
00:06:25,170 --> 00:06:27,830
we still can't pinpoint
the exact location of their hideout.

110
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,530
That's why I forwarded the information

111
00:06:29,550 --> 00:06:31,310
to the other provincial police stations

112
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,990
so they can be on a lookout.

113
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,170
So that means...

114
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,230
Krating

115
00:06:36,550 --> 00:06:39,670
is somewhere in Tak, right?

116
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:42,030
That's likely the case.

117
00:06:42,590 --> 00:06:44,870
The thing is, we don't know
exactly where he is.

118
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,830
But don't worry.

119
00:06:47,110 --> 00:06:49,190
I'm in the process of
requesting that my superiors

120
00:06:49,210 --> 00:06:51,510
put me in charge of this case.

121
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:54,550
If there's any progress,
I'll reach out to you.

122
00:06:55,410 --> 00:06:56,930
Please do, Inspector.

123
00:06:56,950 --> 00:07:00,110
Nevertheless, I want to
catch him with my own hands.

124
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:01,370
Yes.

125
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:04,610
I've contacted the police checkpoints

126
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:06,190
to obtain additional information.

127
00:07:06,310 --> 00:07:08,170
That way, we can identify the car

128
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:10,910
he uses to escape,
including its appearance and license plate.

129
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:14,710
Please let us know
when you have more clues.

130
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,830
Of course, I'll reach out.

131
00:07:16,850 --> 00:07:18,190
- Yes, sir.
- Thank you.

132
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:20,890
Anyway, please excuse me.

133
00:07:20,910 --> 00:07:22,450
I have another case to take care of.

134
00:07:22,470 --> 00:07:23,650
- Yes, sir.
- Oh, right.

135
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:24,250
Alright.

136
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,310
- Excuse me.
- Alright.

137
00:07:28,850 --> 00:07:30,470
- Goodbye.
- Thank you.

138
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:37,270
3:30 P.M.

139
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:39,970
What you need is not something
that may be done with ease.

140
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:42,000
Perils will come your way

141
00:07:42,130 --> 00:07:43,910
from the very instant
you seek the sacred materials.

142
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:47,070
What are you trying to say, Master?

143
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,100
Please tell me.

144
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:52,460
As you gather the sacred materials,

145
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:55,550
the Buddha's virtues
shall spread far and wide.

146
00:07:56,110 --> 00:07:58,720
Restless spirits and ghosts shall storm in

147
00:07:58,810 --> 00:08:00,110
as if a great merit-making ceremony
were underway.

148
00:08:01,470 --> 00:08:03,270
Whatever eyes and ears you boast,

149
00:08:03,410 --> 00:08:05,190
your foes boast the same.

150
00:08:06,010 --> 00:08:08,010
I want you to be very careful, my dearest.

151
00:08:11,030 --> 00:08:13,300
These lethal weapons thirst for blood.

152
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:15,510
Were they placed in
the hands of an evil soul,

153
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:17,770
innocent blood

154
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,270
would be sacrificed.

155
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,670
I promise that

156
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:25,460
only evil blood

157
00:08:25,990 --> 00:08:28,550
will be sacrificed
to the weapons you create.

158
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,670
Above all else,

159
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:31,990
you must seek

160
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:33,570
every material

161
00:08:33,590 --> 00:08:35,230
before sunset.

162
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:37,870
Sunset...

163
00:08:38,710 --> 00:08:40,470
There's a deadline for this?

164
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:41,790
So what if

165
00:08:42,070 --> 00:08:43,370
I couldn't find them all?

166
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,430
Cease your search.

167
00:08:44,490 --> 00:08:46,310
Cherish your life.

168
00:08:46,990 --> 00:08:49,670
Think not that this is
the only night to perform the ritual.

169
00:08:50,230 --> 00:08:52,950
We shall even linger for another full moon.

170
00:08:54,010 --> 00:08:54,850
It'd be too late.

171
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:57,490
I can't wait that long.

172
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,950
If any clues come up,

173
00:09:00,190 --> 00:09:01,990
I have to capture him immediately.

174
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:05,030
Rules are rules.

175
00:09:05,490 --> 00:09:07,890
Nighttime belongs to ghosts.

176
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:10,260
It is not suitable for any endeavor,

177
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,310
unless it be an inauspicious one.

178
00:09:15,490 --> 00:09:17,950
Fulfill your task with every ounce
of mindfulness and wit.

179
00:09:19,060 --> 00:09:20,710
Wrath and vengeance

180
00:09:20,730 --> 00:09:22,430
shall only blind you.

181
00:09:24,310 --> 00:09:27,070
Wear this necklace at all times
until every material is sought.

182
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,790
They shall shield you from all harm.

183
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,080
What is that?

184
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:42,990
Buying lottery tickets?

185
00:09:45,690 --> 00:09:48,160
If I want to find everything on this list,

186
00:09:48,180 --> 00:09:50,350
where's the nearest place I can get them?

187
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:53,130
I have some gold on me.

188
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:56,250
I just need everything else on the list.

189
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,530
Can you recommend a place?

190
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:59,430
I need to get there before sunset.

191
00:09:59,580 --> 00:10:00,640
From here,

192
00:10:00,770 --> 00:10:01,750
the nearest place would be

193
00:10:02,070 --> 00:10:03,250
Rim Moei Market
[Rim Moei Market]

194
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:04,070
in Mae Sot.

195
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:05,710
It's ten minutes from here.

196
00:10:06,350 --> 00:10:07,790
Come on, let's get moving, Sarge.

197
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:10,870
This is the Rim Moei Market
I told you about.

198
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:15,010
So, the stall I'm looking for is right here?

199
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:15,950
Exactly.

200
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:17,660
Here's the stall.

201
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:26,630
Excuse me.

202
00:10:27,950 --> 00:10:29,230
Do you have what I'm looking for?

203
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,020
Whoa...

204
00:10:36,730 --> 00:10:38,590
Where did you folks get this list?

205
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,630
Who gave this to you?

206
00:10:41,690 --> 00:10:43,210
It doesn't matter who.

207
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,950
Do you have them, Shaman?

208
00:10:45,670 --> 00:10:46,430
I do,

209
00:10:47,430 --> 00:10:48,350
but I cannot give them to you.

210
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,350
These items choose their owners.

211
00:10:52,190 --> 00:10:53,910
I cannot just give them out randomly.

212
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:55,750
You...

213
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:57,590
do not possess enough virtue for it.

214
00:10:58,710 --> 00:11:00,070
Your shadow might yet lose its head.

215
00:11:00,170 --> 00:11:02,110
You could've just said it nicely.
Why curse me?!

216
00:11:04,670 --> 00:11:05,890
Let's go somewhere else, Sarge.

217
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:06,830
- Let's!
- Wait!

218
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:17,070
What?!

219
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,710
Hold on...

220
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:43,460
"Blue bornite, guarding against harm,
imbued with might."

221
00:11:43,490 --> 00:11:45,450
[Blue bornite]

222
00:11:46,430 --> 00:11:47,030
Whoa...

223
00:11:49,110 --> 00:11:51,270
Today, deadly misfortune awaits you.

224
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:54,840
You're drunk, right?

225
00:11:55,590 --> 00:11:56,770
Look at that face. Let's go, Lieutenant.

226
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,350
Right.

227
00:11:58,430 --> 00:11:59,150
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

228
00:12:04,990 --> 00:12:05,710
Sarge...

229
00:12:05,950 --> 00:12:06,710
- Blood!
- Yes?

230
00:12:11,950 --> 00:12:12,950
Lieutenant! I got slashed!

231
00:12:13,510 --> 00:12:14,160
I got slashed!

232
00:12:14,270 --> 00:12:15,270
Shaman!

233
00:12:17,830 --> 00:12:18,790
Shaman!

234
00:12:18,810 --> 00:12:20,230
Shaman, help me!

235
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:21,750
I fucking got slashed!

236
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:31,250
Mom, will Dad be alright?

237
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:33,790
How would I know?
What did you do, Priew?

238
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:39,150
Goodness!

239
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:40,330
Dad!

240
00:12:40,350 --> 00:12:41,890
- Dad, Dad!
- Ow, that hurts, that hurts.

241
00:12:41,910 --> 00:12:43,370
Ow, ow, ow, that hurts, that hurts!

242
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:44,510
Let go. You're hurting me.

243
00:12:44,530 --> 00:12:46,010
Ow! That hurts, that hurts.

244
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:48,190
- You're hurting me, you're hurting me.
- Jeez, you're gonna hurt your dad!

245
00:12:48,210 --> 00:12:49,800
- Ow, ow, ow.
- Dad, are you okay?

246
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,310
"Fulfill your task with every ounce
of mindfulness and wit."

247
00:12:53,350 --> 00:12:55,070
"Wrath and vengeance

248
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:56,920
shall only blind you."

249
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,360
Take a seat.

250
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,770
How many pieces have you gathered so far?

251
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:45,700
Counting the gold I already have on hand,

252
00:13:45,910 --> 00:13:47,570
this would be the third piece.

253
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,410
Your clock is ticking

254
00:13:50,130 --> 00:13:51,090
from the instant you started.

255
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,820
Make haste.

256
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:54,820
Eventide

257
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,020
is not a good sign.

258
00:13:58,580 --> 00:13:59,940
You must give me your word

259
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:01,940
that whatever is given to you

260
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,260
will be used only against evil wights.

261
00:14:09,100 --> 00:14:09,780
Yes,

262
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:10,970
I give you my word.

263
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:14,140
I will use it only
to take down the bad guys.

264
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:16,510
Just do not go back on your word.

265
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,700
Should you break it,

266
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,340
it will ricochet back upon you

267
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:23,220
a hundredfold, a thousandfold.

268
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:45,620
"Pure copper, a sacred amulet,
crafted with the master's spell and arts."

269
00:14:47,110 --> 00:14:48,470
What you are looking for.

270
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:52,140
Mortal bodies are impermanent.

271
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:55,900
Even with a prized
and sacred object upon you,

272
00:14:56,170 --> 00:14:58,420
it too will deteriorate with age.

273
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,220
Hurry along.

274
00:15:00,350 --> 00:15:02,120
You do not have much time left.

275
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:04,340
Right.

276
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:07,980
Thank you.

277
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:21,890
Whoa, ma'am.

278
00:15:22,690 --> 00:15:23,530
How did you get here?

279
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:24,900
This place is already closed.

280
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,420
[Kengkla Buakhao, beloved father]

281
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,180
[Date of Birth: January 12, 1958
Date of Death: August 22, 2020]

282
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,840
[Sirichai379: Construction materials,
plumbing and electrical supplies,

283
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:43,500
construction hardware,
hand tools, and gardening tools]

284
00:15:45,100 --> 00:15:46,060
Whoa, hey!

285
00:15:46,530 --> 00:15:47,740
Just make sure it's nice and tight.

286
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,600
If you drive off
and they fall onto someone,

287
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,660
we'll all be screwed.

288
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:53,820
If it's gonna fall,

289
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:56,440
it's either on your head or mine, man,

290
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:58,180
not anyone else's.

291
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,700
Jeez,

292
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:02,940
you've really learned to talk back.

293
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:05,040
- Come on, man.
- How about I backhand you?

294
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:09,900
Hey, Seua.

295
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:12,600
Who's that lady walking towards us?

296
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,140
She's gorgeous, man.

297
00:16:16,290 --> 00:16:18,220
Hello, beautiful.

298
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:19,460
I'm Seua.

299
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:21,420
Anything I can help you with?

300
00:16:21,590 --> 00:16:22,900
I'm looking to buy some metal.

301
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,620
Well, what kind do you need?

302
00:16:25,010 --> 00:16:26,570
Angle bars, steel bars,

303
00:16:26,700 --> 00:16:27,740
or round bars?

304
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,460
You can tell me anything.

305
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:32,080
I'll get you whatever you need, beautiful.

306
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:33,380
I'm the owner here.

307
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,900
We have all kinds of metal.

308
00:16:35,980 --> 00:16:36,940
Fabled iron,

309
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:38,580
do you sell that?

310
00:16:38,900 --> 00:16:39,980
- Fabled iron.
- Fabled iron.

311
00:16:41,260 --> 00:16:42,020
Oud,

312
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:44,040
get her the fabled iron from the back.

313
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:45,480
Get her a really shiny one.

314
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:46,460
Sure thing, man.

315
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,620
- Are you crazy?
- What?!

316
00:16:47,780 --> 00:16:49,660
- Jeez.
- What fabled iron? We don't have that.

317
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,780
Beautiful,

318
00:16:51,130 --> 00:16:52,550
we only sell steel bars here.

319
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:54,500
If you want fabled iron,

320
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:55,860
you'll have to go into the woods.

321
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:58,020
But if you really wanna go there,

322
00:16:58,620 --> 00:16:59,940
I'll take you.

323
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,460
We've gotta go pretty deep, though.

324
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,240
Be careful,

325
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,580
or Seua the Tiger could maul you. Nom!

326
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:09,020
Oops, just an ordinary tiger, that is.

327
00:17:09,350 --> 00:17:10,620
Still interested?

328
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:11,940
So you don't sell them?

329
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:14,420
How could I?

330
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:15,740
I've only ever seen steel bars.

331
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,140
Seua! Oud!

332
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,360
You two bastards.

333
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:21,820
Why are you talking
to a customer like that?

334
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:23,420
Jeez, Dad.

335
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:25,380
This beautiful girl wants fabled iron.

336
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:26,940
We only have steel bars.

337
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:29,500
I just offered
to take her there, that's all.

338
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:31,460
Fabled iron?

339
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:32,700
Yes.

340
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:41,830
Follow me inside.

341
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,600
Hold out your hand.

342
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:04,300
Jeez, Dad.

343
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,200
Tryna get handsy with a lady?

344
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,100
Seua!

345
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:09,300
Go back to work at once.

346
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:11,740
I know, Dad. You didn't have
to chase me away.

347
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:13,780
Beautiful,

348
00:18:13,910 --> 00:18:15,530
gonna deliver some stuff for a sec.

349
00:18:16,020 --> 00:18:17,340
Don't miss me just yet.

350
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:22,620
I'll be right back.

351
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:28,380
I have no ill intentions like my son does.

352
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:30,380
Do not be afraid.

353
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:32,900
Hold out your hand.

354
00:18:34,620 --> 00:18:35,700
Sit down!

355
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:38,280
Dare you come,

356
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,780
think not of fear.

357
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:33,660
Uncle.

358
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,780
Uncle, Uncle. Whoa...

359
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:38,700
Let's go, Uncle. Get up slowly.

360
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:42,920
Hey, get a move on

361
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:44,340
so we can deliver these to the customer.

362
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:46,580
You bet, Seua.

363
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,300
All you do is talk, man.

364
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,540
I'm just heading out.

365
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,140
What the hell are you still doing?

366
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,960
Something's wrong with the truck.

367
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:02,340
The gear stick wouldn't budge.

368
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:04,220
Give it another try.

369
00:20:05,330 --> 00:20:06,340
It won't budge, man.

370
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:08,420
Get out, then. I'll handle it.

371
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:14,900
What the hell?

372
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:19,500
Fucking bastard!
Why did you lock the door?

373
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:22,920
I didn't. It locked itself, man.

374
00:20:22,940 --> 00:20:24,700
Bullshit. The door is fucking locked!

375
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:38,700
Seua!

376
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:40,380
Take your dad to the doctor!

377
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:41,980
Who's calling you, man?

378
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:43,380
Can you walk?

379
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,620
"Fabled iron,
invulnerable, a mighty rampart."

380
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:40,460
You must seek

381
00:21:40,660 --> 00:21:43,500
every material before sunset.

382
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:10,160
[Sirichai379 - Steel Merchant
Wat Pa Lan Romyen]

383
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:20,370
He is typically hard to come across,

384
00:23:20,540 --> 00:23:23,220
as he favors a life in the wild.

385
00:23:24,330 --> 00:23:27,900
It is fortunate that, on occasion,

386
00:23:28,910 --> 00:23:31,500
you can still meet the huntsman here.

387
00:23:31,820 --> 00:23:33,740
It is better than making your way

388
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:36,380
to Mon Kru Ba.

389
00:23:43,940 --> 00:23:47,700
This is a reward for your endeavor.

390
00:23:48,460 --> 00:23:50,340
The ancient Sangkhawanon nail,

391
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:54,210
pulled from the roof
of an old ordination hall,

392
00:23:55,130 --> 00:23:56,530
serves as

393
00:23:57,320 --> 00:23:58,340
an alloy element.

394
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:17,330
"Zinc of yore, interlaced with all else,
their powers unveiled."

395
00:24:19,870 --> 00:24:23,380
Relinquish it to her, Loh-Se.

396
00:24:37,740 --> 00:24:39,060
What do you still need?

397
00:24:45,650 --> 00:24:46,530
I'm still missing...

398
00:24:46,830 --> 00:24:48,980
wild mercury and untainted silver.

399
00:24:49,740 --> 00:24:50,820
I don't have untainted silver,

400
00:24:51,740 --> 00:24:53,180
just wild mercury.

401
00:25:11,860 --> 00:25:13,140
Thank you.

402
00:25:13,740 --> 00:25:16,620
"Wild mercury, reflecting poison
and sorcery's blight."

403
00:25:17,180 --> 00:25:18,380
If you have time,

404
00:25:19,780 --> 00:25:21,980
I can take you into the woods
to find untainted silver.

405
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:33,340
I only have until sunset today.

406
00:25:34,020 --> 00:25:35,580
I gave someone my word.

407
00:25:36,810 --> 00:25:38,290
Then, I'm sorry

408
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:40,750
I can't follow through.

409
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:45,930
Though you've already done
more than enough.

410
00:25:46,700 --> 00:25:48,140
Gathering

411
00:25:49,740 --> 00:25:51,340
these materials

412
00:25:51,360 --> 00:25:52,900
is no easy feat.

413
00:25:54,260 --> 00:25:56,740
Even masters of sacred arts

414
00:25:57,940 --> 00:26:00,140
can take anywhere from a month to a year.

415
00:26:07,800 --> 00:26:10,000
Do not hold that thought.

416
00:26:12,020 --> 00:26:14,140
Had they not placed their faith in you,

417
00:26:14,800 --> 00:26:17,480
you would have never made it here

418
00:26:18,540 --> 00:26:23,980
to see Loh-Se and me.

419
00:26:26,820 --> 00:26:31,240
It is now up to you.

420
00:26:31,800 --> 00:26:33,140
If you are determined

421
00:26:33,420 --> 00:26:34,980
to fulfill it,

422
00:26:35,620 --> 00:26:36,820
fate...

423
00:26:37,340 --> 00:26:41,220
will guide you to fulfill what you have set

424
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:42,420
your heart on.

425
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:01,740
Thank you.

426
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:10,900
May you be blessed and protected.

427
00:27:11,700 --> 00:27:12,900
Thank you.

428
00:27:27,380 --> 00:27:28,460
What are you doing?

429
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:31,120
The water is perfectly cold.

430
00:27:31,140 --> 00:27:32,900
It will ease your soreness.

431
00:27:38,580 --> 00:27:40,100
Soak your feet in it.

432
00:27:44,540 --> 00:27:45,740
Thank you.

433
00:27:59,860 --> 00:28:01,420
Are you well, my dearest?

434
00:28:04,770 --> 00:28:05,730
It's nothing.

435
00:28:09,220 --> 00:28:11,460
I'm just mad at myself for...

436
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:14,820
not being able
to gather all the materials.

437
00:28:16,860 --> 00:28:18,100
I'm sorry.

438
00:28:19,980 --> 00:28:21,740
There are, in fact,

439
00:28:21,940 --> 00:28:24,620
many people in this vicinity
who possess auspicious objects.

440
00:28:25,500 --> 00:28:26,860
Perhaps you merely...

441
00:28:27,250 --> 00:28:28,910
have not asked all of them.

442
00:28:39,380 --> 00:28:40,600
This is for you.

443
00:28:51,940 --> 00:28:55,260
"Untainted silver, breaking curses
beneath the moon's hold."

444
00:28:59,580 --> 00:29:00,540
Really?

445
00:29:02,540 --> 00:29:03,660
Thank you.

446
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:05,780
Thank you, truly.

447
00:29:07,580 --> 00:29:10,060
Next time,
should you injure yourself again,

448
00:29:11,180 --> 00:29:12,940
I shall make it worse.

449
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:17,740
Copy that.

450
00:29:30,980 --> 00:29:34,420
"Lustrous gold, burning like the sun,
with power untold."

451
00:29:36,420 --> 00:29:37,460
Hold on.

452
00:29:39,820 --> 00:29:41,420
Cleave to the gold.

453
00:29:42,930 --> 00:29:44,730
It is no good to take it off your neck.

454
00:29:45,900 --> 00:29:47,580
I own plenty of gold.

455
00:29:48,500 --> 00:29:50,180
I shall endow it to you.

456
00:29:54,930 --> 00:29:56,690
You have endured much today.

457
00:29:57,220 --> 00:29:58,860
Let me take care of you.

458
00:30:07,490 --> 00:30:08,590
Are you holding up well?

459
00:30:18,380 --> 00:30:19,620
You are adorable.

460
00:30:27,710 --> 00:30:29,470
Thank you, once again.

461
00:31:26,930 --> 00:31:28,610
Master In's sanctum.

462
00:31:30,630 --> 00:31:31,850
My father.

463
00:32:22,850 --> 00:32:23,690
My dearest,

464
00:32:23,950 --> 00:32:25,190
pray you come to me.

465
00:32:34,870 --> 00:32:36,230
Master In...

466
00:32:38,660 --> 00:32:39,900
My father.

467
00:32:46,030 --> 00:32:47,790
Dignified

468
00:32:49,500 --> 00:32:51,040
and formidable.

469
00:32:54,740 --> 00:32:56,380
Just like his daughter.

470
00:33:11,130 --> 00:33:12,610
So, this place...

471
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,780
Does no one really live here?

472
00:33:15,330 --> 00:33:16,540
Why...

473
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:19,100
is there no dust

474
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:21,040
or...

475
00:33:22,620 --> 00:33:23,900
cobwebs?

476
00:33:25,930 --> 00:33:27,770
Ever since he passed,

477
00:33:28,280 --> 00:33:29,920
no one has lingered here,

478
00:33:31,470 --> 00:33:32,830
save for me

479
00:33:32,850 --> 00:33:34,690
and his disciples,

480
00:33:34,710 --> 00:33:36,740
who take turns visiting
and paying their respects.

481
00:33:38,300 --> 00:33:40,230
As for my mother,
she dwells at the temple.

482
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:45,160
Your mother...

483
00:33:48,780 --> 00:33:50,180
already passed?

484
00:33:52,220 --> 00:33:54,950
I suppose you would think so.

485
00:33:55,860 --> 00:33:57,860
My mother has kept the precepts

486
00:33:58,140 --> 00:34:01,140
and been ordained as a Buddhist nun
ever since Master passed.

487
00:34:02,500 --> 00:34:04,760
Though only a few souls
are acquainted with her.

488
00:34:08,020 --> 00:34:09,920
She was beauteous,

489
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:12,340
and Master was protective of her,

490
00:34:12,940 --> 00:34:14,300
so he never let her go anywhere.

491
00:34:16,040 --> 00:34:16,860
Apart from me,

492
00:34:17,220 --> 00:34:20,080
Mother often pays this place a visit.

493
00:34:29,670 --> 00:34:31,890
Judging by her daughter,

494
00:34:33,240 --> 00:34:35,460
it goes without saying that...

495
00:34:37,820 --> 00:34:40,100
your mother must be very beautiful.

496
00:35:05,300 --> 00:35:07,540
I was also wondering

497
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:11,180
why you wanted me
to look for the materials from...

498
00:35:11,910 --> 00:35:13,150
these people.

499
00:35:31,570 --> 00:35:32,490
Is that

500
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:34,380
the bullet forge?

501
00:35:48,600 --> 00:35:51,720
Did your father use this place...

502
00:35:51,740 --> 00:35:53,180
to make the consecrated bullets?

503
00:35:56,200 --> 00:35:57,580
In his time,

504
00:35:57,600 --> 00:36:00,230
the land abounded with
bandits and wicked thieves.

505
00:36:00,820 --> 00:36:03,420
Spells and incantations alone
would not suffice.

506
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,820
They too had to be masters of weapons.

507
00:36:11,780 --> 00:36:13,460
If this world

508
00:36:13,740 --> 00:36:16,200
were full of criminals who knew such arts,

509
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:19,640
police officers like me,
with no knowledge of spells,

510
00:36:20,140 --> 00:36:23,420
would never be able
to bring them to justice.

511
00:36:27,820 --> 00:36:29,060
When it comes to science,

512
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:31,780
there are molecules invisible to the eyes.

513
00:36:33,110 --> 00:36:34,150
Oceans

514
00:36:34,350 --> 00:36:36,530
are too sublime to ever be discovered.

515
00:36:37,580 --> 00:36:38,940
You must truly believe

516
00:36:39,540 --> 00:36:43,220
that things that transcend
far beyond mundane limits are true.

517
00:36:45,380 --> 00:36:47,360
Faith, too, has no shape or form.

518
00:36:48,140 --> 00:36:50,740
How could you know
if something were wicked,

519
00:36:53,180 --> 00:36:55,300
should there not be morals to begin with?

520
00:36:57,220 --> 00:36:59,980
The entirety of this earth

521
00:37:00,260 --> 00:37:01,560
was created

522
00:37:01,580 --> 00:37:03,740
with the belief
that all things shall be possible.

523
00:37:04,820 --> 00:37:07,220
You must merely have faith and believe;

524
00:37:07,770 --> 00:37:08,880
otherwise,

525
00:37:08,900 --> 00:37:10,660
there is no point making your way here.

526
00:37:13,240 --> 00:37:13,920
Right.

527
00:37:14,740 --> 00:37:17,740
I have readied
all the crucial sacred materials.

528
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:20,620
All that is left is to await the full moon,

529
00:37:20,640 --> 00:37:22,100
when we shall perform the ritual.

530
00:37:27,780 --> 00:37:28,740
Alright.

531
00:37:32,820 --> 00:37:34,060
In the meantime...

532
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,640
there is a place

533
00:37:36,390 --> 00:37:37,940
I wish you to accompany me to.

534
00:38:32,930 --> 00:38:34,130
In my tender years,

535
00:38:35,060 --> 00:38:36,660
I took great joy in sitting here at leisure.

536
00:38:47,550 --> 00:38:49,230
Can I ask you something?

537
00:38:50,700 --> 00:38:51,660
Why...

538
00:38:52,620 --> 00:38:54,100
did you become a master?

539
00:38:56,580 --> 00:38:58,480
My father before me was a master,

540
00:38:59,270 --> 00:39:00,750
a deeply respected one.

541
00:39:02,160 --> 00:39:05,100
He inherited the sacred arts
from my grandfather.

542
00:39:07,510 --> 00:39:08,630
Back then...

543
00:39:09,080 --> 00:39:11,080
I was a naive soul.

544
00:39:11,940 --> 00:39:14,220
All I knew was that
I held him in profound respect,

545
00:39:15,940 --> 00:39:18,470
as everyone revered and worshipped him.

546
00:39:21,860 --> 00:39:23,580
Though with the passage of time,

547
00:39:25,140 --> 00:39:26,910
people developed a dislike for him.

548
00:39:28,820 --> 00:39:30,560
They called him deceptive

549
00:39:30,740 --> 00:39:31,940
and dogmatic.

550
00:39:33,510 --> 00:39:35,290
Some were frightened by him.

551
00:39:36,860 --> 00:39:39,230
So, as I matured and became more aware,

552
00:39:40,270 --> 00:39:42,660
I did not come to enjoy the state of things.

553
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:46,560
Until I was thirteen or fourteen,

554
00:39:48,220 --> 00:39:49,980
I was at death's door.

555
00:39:50,580 --> 00:39:52,420
No treatment could fully cure me.

556
00:39:54,410 --> 00:39:56,890
The doctor said
I was not long for this world.

557
00:39:57,670 --> 00:40:00,080
Other children would have died by then.

558
00:40:01,740 --> 00:40:04,020
Thus, my father took me to make a vow,

559
00:40:05,080 --> 00:40:07,220
praying for the sacred hermit sage's aid.

560
00:40:10,140 --> 00:40:12,540
Afterwards, I grew better and better,

561
00:40:13,030 --> 00:40:14,590
as if by a miracle.

562
00:40:20,100 --> 00:40:21,380
So that's why...

563
00:40:22,340 --> 00:40:24,580
you became a master?

564
00:40:26,020 --> 00:40:26,700
Not yet.

565
00:40:27,940 --> 00:40:29,820
There were times I was skeptical

566
00:40:32,020 --> 00:40:33,810
and stubborn, like any child,

567
00:40:37,060 --> 00:40:38,840
but after just a sip of liquor,

568
00:40:38,860 --> 00:40:40,530
I became ill once again.

569
00:40:41,730 --> 00:40:43,410
At that breath, I dared not be stubborn,

570
00:40:44,740 --> 00:40:46,980
for it all ran in my blood

571
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:49,160
and through my body.

572
00:40:50,620 --> 00:40:52,420
Were I to consider escape,

573
00:40:54,470 --> 00:40:56,390
the only thing waiting ahead

574
00:40:56,870 --> 00:40:58,350
would be death.

575
00:41:00,820 --> 00:41:03,390
Thus, I decided to accept
the sacred master's rite.

576
00:41:08,890 --> 00:41:10,290
Palms together, bow your head.

577
00:41:15,570 --> 00:41:18,910
Metta Gunnang Arahang Metta
Namo Buddhaya.

578
00:41:18,930 --> 00:41:22,100
Gunnang Arahang Metta
Namo Buddhaya.

579
00:41:23,250 --> 00:41:26,740
Metta Gunnang Arahang Metta
Namo Buddhaya.

580
00:41:26,770 --> 00:41:29,250
Namo Buddhaya.

581
00:41:34,600 --> 00:41:35,520
We are all done.

582
00:42:11,220 --> 00:42:12,140
Have you any notion

583
00:42:15,060 --> 00:42:17,360
that I wish for death
to finally come to me?

584
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:22,300
But Master bade me live,

585
00:42:22,590 --> 00:42:24,830
make merit, and keep the precepts,

586
00:42:26,780 --> 00:42:29,680
as my karmic soulmate
had already been incarnated.

587
00:42:30,660 --> 00:42:32,060
He bade me stay,

588
00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:33,480
never to leave,

589
00:42:34,650 --> 00:42:36,210
so that when they arrived,

590
00:42:37,090 --> 00:42:38,490
our paths would cross.

591
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:14,120
If the person
you're waiting for isn't me...

592
00:43:17,270 --> 00:43:19,150
you can be honest, my beloved.

593
00:43:22,530 --> 00:43:23,360
If...

594
00:43:23,720 --> 00:43:26,040
they can be your happiness,

595
00:43:29,900 --> 00:43:31,990
I would be happy for you.

596
00:43:35,190 --> 00:43:36,830
After all the time we have spent,

597
00:43:38,440 --> 00:43:41,060
know you not of my nature?

598
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:49,640
I yearn to feel you till my heart breaks.

599
00:43:52,250 --> 00:43:53,450
But it is not the time.

600
00:43:55,510 --> 00:43:57,850
Today, we have a much greater aim.

601
00:44:00,130 --> 00:44:02,010
Once it is fulfilled,

602
00:44:02,490 --> 00:44:04,860
you shall pay me ever so dearly

603
00:44:12,380 --> 00:44:14,690
for every ounce of strength I expend.

604
00:44:21,250 --> 00:44:22,090
I mean...

605
00:44:22,890 --> 00:44:26,010
I just need assurance that

606
00:44:27,760 --> 00:44:29,680
you genuinely have feelings for me,

607
00:44:32,020 --> 00:44:35,180
not because of
what your father told you to believe.

608
00:44:40,570 --> 00:44:42,210
Unto my last breath,

609
00:44:43,610 --> 00:44:46,140
I long for no one
to be by my side but you,

610
00:44:47,210 --> 00:44:48,880
and you alone.

611
00:44:51,350 --> 00:44:52,330
Therefore,

612
00:44:52,630 --> 00:44:55,480
do not dwell too much
on my father's words.

613
00:44:57,550 --> 00:44:58,570
No way.

614
00:45:00,930 --> 00:45:02,340
You can't do that, my beloved.

615
00:45:03,460 --> 00:45:04,220
If...

616
00:45:05,220 --> 00:45:07,580
something happens to me one day,

617
00:45:08,560 --> 00:45:11,570
you need to give yourself
a chance, you know that?

618
00:45:15,520 --> 00:45:19,110
I don't ever want
to see you alone and forlorn again.

619
00:45:26,110 --> 00:45:27,530
If one day,

620
00:45:27,890 --> 00:45:30,010
death should bereave you of me,

621
00:45:32,020 --> 00:45:33,660
do enshrine this...

622
00:45:36,780 --> 00:45:38,500
death shall never...

623
00:45:39,040 --> 00:45:41,020
bereave me of my love for you.

624
00:45:41,970 --> 00:45:42,930
Mm,

625
00:45:43,490 --> 00:45:44,290
then...

626
00:45:45,550 --> 00:45:47,870
I will take good care of myself

627
00:45:48,690 --> 00:45:50,480
and be very mindful,

628
00:45:50,670 --> 00:45:51,510
so that...

629
00:45:52,190 --> 00:45:55,170
I can live a long, long, long life.

630
00:45:57,770 --> 00:45:58,810
As for...

631
00:46:05,410 --> 00:46:07,170
all the strength...

632
00:46:08,070 --> 00:46:10,530
you expend making the bullets today,

633
00:46:23,110 --> 00:46:24,890
I'll make it up to you.

634
00:46:29,010 --> 00:46:29,810
With...

635
00:46:30,810 --> 00:46:32,490
every ounce of strength I have.

636
00:46:48,870 --> 00:46:50,290
Are you actually so touched that you cry?

637
00:47:03,680 --> 00:47:13,910
♫At this hour, I shall solemnly solicit♫

638
00:47:13,930 --> 00:47:20,180
♫The sacred master
to whom I am deeply indebted♫

639
00:47:20,200 --> 00:47:26,330
♫To protect and to shield my spirit♫

640
00:47:26,350 --> 00:47:35,730
♫With the holy mantra,♫

641
00:47:36,510 --> 00:47:44,050
♫Incantation, and sorcery
arching over the sky♫

642
00:47:44,070 --> 00:47:59,130
♫There dwell ethereal blessings,
veiled in protection, to guard the mortal wight♫

643
