Don't act like you're gonna listen
when I tell you not to.

647
00:49:42,260 --> 00:49:43,540
Thank you, brother.

648
00:49:48,790 --> 00:49:49,910
What's up, Singh?

649
00:49:54,070 --> 00:49:56,370
They actually did it, huh...

650
00:49:57,590 --> 00:50:00,490
Well, gotta be proud of their attempt.

651
00:50:01,210 --> 00:50:02,920
But unfortunately,

652
00:50:04,400 --> 00:50:06,590
