653
00:50:34,680 --> 00:50:35,580
Lieutenant!

654
00:50:36,270 --> 00:50:37,070
Lieutenant!

655
00:50:46,430 --> 00:50:47,230
Lieutenant!

656
00:51:44,430 --> 00:51:45,230
What is the matter?

657
00:51:45,680 --> 00:51:47,920
Mom is in danger.

658
00:51:51,800 --> 00:51:52,520
Thong,

659
00:51:52,670 --> 00:51:53,630
go help your mom.

660
00:51:53,830 --> 00:51:55,280
I shall follow shortly.

661
00:52:21,120 --> 00:52:23,040
I am happy for you, Master,

662
00:52:23,390 --> 00:52:25,060
