665
00:52:28,020 --> 00:52:28,960
No wonder...

666
00:52:29,170 --> 00:52:31,170
she is Master Bulan's karmic soulmate.

667
00:52:31,650 --> 00:52:33,780
Yantra or guns,

668
00:52:34,060 --> 00:52:35,980
should you harbor ill intentions,

669
00:52:36,220 --> 00:52:39,140
severe consequences shall follow.

670
00:52:40,280 --> 00:52:42,580
You yourself shall not use
the consecrated bullets

671
00:52:43,420 --> 00:52:45,560
until you are certain
that the person before you...

672
00:52:46,540 --> 00:52:48,870
is truly one upon
whom they should be used.

